Clinical Course: Without rapid, high-dose intravenous steroids, the damage to your nerves and your bowel can become permanent or life-threatening. The hospital will aggressively treat the inflammation to stabilize your condition.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

You must go directly to the hospital in an ambulance. Do not attempt to eat or drink anything, as the surgeons need to evaluate your stomach immediately. Do not try to walk.

